wouldn't never played games.

01:00:06.180 --> 01:00:09.540
Like I don't recall, I mean, as you and I,

01:00:09.540 --> 01:00:11.315
we would never play games.

01:00:11.315 --> 01:00:12.148
Well, like I said,

01:00:12.148 --> 01:00:14.000
we didn't have games
in my house growing up.

01:00:14.000 --> 01:00:15.120
We didn't have Scrabble.

01:00:15.120 --> 01:00:16.780
I played Scrabble probably the first time

01:00:16.780 --> 01:00:20.600
