Jessie's parents had it.

01:00:20.600 --> 01:00:21.840
And they let us sit down and play Scrabble

01:00:21.840 --> 01:00:23.823
and I'm like, all right, I know words.

01:00:24.750 --> 01:00:26.960
Apparently not nearly
as many as Jessie's mom.

01:00:26.960 --> 01:00:29.143
I don't think that I am,

01:00:32.630 --> 01:00:34.800
it's not really about,
am I competitive or not?

01:00:34.800 --> 01:00:36.507
There's also a second
factor along with that.

01:00:36.507 --> 01:00:38.520
That's like the group dynamic.

01:00:38.520 --> 01:00:41.270
Yeah, trying to set
the scene for a family.

01:00:41.270 --> 01:00:43.300
Well, what I'm saying?

01:00:43.300 --> 01:00:46.510
Yes, I think I'm most
interested in that with family,

01:00:46.510 --> 01:00:49.680
my family and none of
us are that competitive.

01:00:49.680 --> 01:00:53.560
Like nobody gets that upset
about winning or losing

01:00:53.560 --> 01:00:56.070
or anything and at least at this point,

01:00:56.070 --> 01:00:57.720
maybe we'll get more competitive,

01:00:59.003 --> 01:01:01.120
but we'll be on that journey together.

01:01:01.120 --> 01:01:04.600
I think that I was turned
off by being in environments

01:01:04.600 --> 01:01:05.900
