01:01:51.027 --> 01:01:52.940
"Okay, I don't want to play
this game again 'cause I lost."

01:01:52.940 --> 01:01:56.065
He's like, "I wanna play this
game again because I lost."

01:01:56.065 --> 01:01:58.410
But I don't think,

01:01:58.410 --> 01:01:59.780
I'm trying to set the stage for,

01:01:59.780 --> 01:02:01.640
I actually don't think I'm competitive.

01:02:01.640 --> 01:02:04.493
You think I'm competitive,
