01:05:30.040 --> 01:05:31.730
And so--

01:05:31.730 --> 01:05:35.840
But I am generally not
competitive, like sports.

01:05:35.840 --> 01:05:36.900
But there are people--

01:05:36.900 --> 01:05:38.580
Like games.

01:05:38.580 --> 01:05:41.420
But there are people
who, okay, Catch Phrase,

