01:06:47.780 --> 01:06:49.390
It's like who, I don't,

01:06:49.390 --> 01:06:51.210
and I just I'm saying that, okay.

01:06:51.210 --> 01:06:52.580
I will definitely can see that

01:06:52.580 --> 01:06:53.790
you're not as competitive as me,

01:06:53.790 --> 01:06:56.090
but you're more competitive
than you give yourself credit.

01:06:56.090 --> 01:06:58.330
I think I'm adaptable to,

01:06:58.330 --> 01:07:00.400
