And the way you participate
because you're competitive.

01:07:11.920 --> 01:07:13.850
I think you're misinterpreting me

01:07:13.850 --> 01:07:18.420
as being competitive when
I'm just being playful.

01:07:18.420 --> 01:07:20.470
Like I'm actually like, I'm here to play.

01:07:20.470 --> 01:07:21.780
I'm here, I don't,

