introspection and arguments

01:10:45.360 --> 01:10:48.263
and an apology.

01:10:49.380 --> 01:10:52.470
I'm sensationalizing,
'cause I really do want--

01:10:52.470 --> 01:10:53.340
It got very deep.

01:10:53.340 --> 01:10:56.063
I want him to listen to part two,

01:11:00.020 --> 01:11:01.020
'cause I think it's,

01:11:02.103 --> 01:11:03.500
I'm gonna be thinking a lot about it.

01:11:03.500 --> 01:11:05.470
Just to set the stage,

01:11:05.470 --> 01:11:07.780
'cause you're gonna have to
wait a week to listen to it.

01:11:07.780 --> 01:11:10.310
So as you know, we were
talking about board games

01:11:12.440 --> 01:11:14.440
and I've talked about this many times,

01:11:14.440 --> 01:11:16.740
I've talked about my theory that Link is

01:11:17.630 --> 01:11:20.793
just as competitive as me in quotes.

01:11:21.930 --> 01:11:24.390
And that led to a conversation--

01:11:24.390 --> 01:11:26.207
And I've never liked
it when you said that.

01:11:26.207 --> 01:11:27.760
And I don't know exactly why.

01:11:27.760 --> 01:11:32.600
About a, boy it got very,
it just got very deep.

01:11:32.600 --> 01:11:36.483
It got very personal, very
vulnerable from both sides.

01:11:37.800 --> 01:11:40.790
And we ended up talking about
the dynamics of our friendship

01:11:40.790 --> 01:11:43.830
and our creative partnership
and how we think differently

01:11:43.830 --> 01:11:46.907
about it and what we, how
we think the same about it.

01:11:46.907 --> 01:11:50.170
And I just didn't want that conversation

01:11:50.170 --> 01:11:53.700
to get buried at the end
of an entire episode,

01:11:53.700 --> 01:11:55.183
about something else,

01:11:56.230 --> 01:12:00.370
about board games and movies and our kids.

01:12:00.370 --> 01:12:04.670
And so you may be frustrated with us

01:12:04.670 --> 01:12:07.460
that we're making you
wait another week for it,

01:12:07.460 --> 01:12:11.160
but we poured a lot of ourselves into it

01:12:11.160 --> 01:12:12.410
and I don't want it to get buried and--

01:12:12.410 --> 01:12:15.980
And not to be competitive,
but if you're frustrated,

01:12:15.980 --> 01:12:18.250
you can drag your frustration at Link.

01:12:18.250 --> 01:12:19.873
'Cause this was his idea.

01:12:21.317 --> 01:12:24.290
I don't like having a two
and a half hour podcast

01:12:24.290 --> 01:12:26.130
when it's like--

01:12:26.130 --> 01:12:28.810
I believe this is the
right choice actually.

01:12:28.810 --> 01:12:32.980
And it puts something front and center

01:12:32.980 --> 01:12:36.230
